{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4f6d8983-9092-8de3-9bc3-76ed2e1e55e4",
  "created_at": "2026-01-15T13:49:20-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Mei Kim",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:47:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:47:10-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, Mei Kim. I'm calling about the crosswalk in front of 188 Farewell Street, up in the North End. The paint's faded almost to nothing and cars just don't stop for people."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:47:23-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 188 Farewell. So the crosswalk markings are worn off. Is it a marked crossing with the lines, or the old ladder-style stripes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:47:33-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Stripes, the ladder kind. You can barely see them now. Maybe a faint ghost of the edges if the sun hits it right. Drivers come through at full speed and nobody slows down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:47:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, got it. Faded crosswalk, vehicles not yielding. Anything else going on with the road there? Potholes, cracking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:47:54-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few rough patches, but the crosswalk is the main thing. It's also on a bus route, so there are people crossing to the stop all day. Riders, school kids, folks with groceries."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:48:07-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense, I'll put the bus route in the notes. That helps with priority."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:48:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Can you add the street to the repair list? Repaint the crosswalk and look at those patches while they're there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:48:23-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, I'll add Farewell Street to the list and write it up as a repaint request with the road surface noted. Crews usually do paint once the weather warms up, so don't expect it this week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:48:37-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'm not expecting it in January. I just want it on the list before spring. I walk down to the farmers market in the warm months, that's where I get my honey, and I cross there every time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:48:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nice, local honey's the best. Okay, do you want a callback when it's scheduled, or just leave it in the system?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:49:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A callback is fine. It's 401-555-0150."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:49:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-oh. Mei Kim, 188 Farewell Street, crosswalk repaint and surface check, bus route. Did I get it all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:49:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's everything. Thanks, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:49:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:49:18-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
